{"type":"frame-snapshot","snapshot":{"callId":"call@29","phase":"after","pageId":"page@68e2211dfb31ccaef20e45a1bf07d127","frameId":"frame@a4964340cee0cebce0bece8518d2a1a5","frameUrl":"http://127.0.0.1:5173/boutique?type=coffrets-autres","doctype":"html","html":["HTML",{"lang":"fr"},["HEAD",{},["BASE",{"href":"http://127.0.0.1:5173/boutique?type=coffrets-autres"}],"\n  ","\n\n  ","\n\n  ",["META",{"charset":"utf-8"}],"\n  ",["META",{"name":"viewport","content":"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"}],"\n  ",["LINK",{"rel":"icon","type":"image/svg+xml","href":"/favicon.svg"}],"\n  ",["META",{"name":"theme-color","content":"#f7f6f3"}],"\n  ",["META",{"name":"description","content":"Découvrez une sélection de soins coréens authentiques, livrés partout au Maroc. Paiement à la livraison."}],"\n  ",["TITLE",{},"La boutique | K-Skin Gallery"],"\n",["STYLE",{},"@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;500;600&display=swap');\n\n:root {\n  font-family: 'DM Sans', Arial, sans-serif;\n  color: #282526;\n  background: #f7f6f3;\n  font-synthesis: none;\n  text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;\n  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n  --gallery-white: #f7f6f3;\n  --canvas: #efeae3;\n  --blush: #f1cdd5;\n  --petal: #fcebed;\n  --ink: #282526;\n  --rose: #a7546b;\n  --line: #e6e0da;\n  --serif: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\nhtml {\n  scroll-behavior: smooth;\n  scroll-padding-top: 25px;\n}\n\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-width: 320px;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  background: var(--gallery-white);\n}\n\nbutton,\ninput {\n  font: inherit;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  color: inherit;\n}\n\nbutton:focus-visible,\na:focus-visible,\ninput:focus-visible {\n  outline: 2px solid var(--rose);\n  outline-offset: 3px;\n}\n\na {\n  color: inherit;\n  text-decoration: none;\n}\n\n.site-shell {\n  width: 100%;\n  overflow-x: clip;\n}\n\n.trust-bar {\n  height: 35px;\n  background: #f6e7e9;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: clamp(22px, 6.2vw, 98px);\n  color: #51464a;\n  font-size: 11px;\n  letter-spacing: .01em;\n}\n\n.trust-item {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 9px;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n.trust-item svg {\n  color: var(--rose);\n}\n\n.trust-divider {\n  width: 1px;\n  height: 16px;\n  background: #d7c5c8;\n}\n\n.site-header {\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 5;\n  background: #fffdfa;\n}\n\n.header-main {\n  max-width: 1440px;\n  height: 105px;\n  padding: 8px 4.3%;\n  margin: auto;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 265px minmax(280px, 1fr) 285px;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: clamp(22px, 4vw, 62px);\n}\n\n.logo-link {\n  display: block;\n  width: 255px;\n  line-height: 0;\n}\n\n.brand-logo {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: auto;\n  display: block;\n}\n\n.search-wrap {\n  height: 45px;\n  position: relative;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e2ded9;\n  border-radius: 5px;\n}\n\n.search-wrap:focus-within {\n  border-color: #b77b8b;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #a7546b14;\n}\n\n.search-icon {\n  margin-left: 15px;\n  flex: 0 0 auto;\n  color: var(--ink);\n}\n\n.search-wrap input {\n  min-width: 0;\n  flex: 1;\n  height: 100%;\n  border: 0;\n  outline: 0;\n  background: transparent;\n  padding: 0 13px;\n  color: var(--ink);\n  font-size: 12px;\n}\n\n.search-wrap input::placeholder {\n  color: #797478;\n}\n\n.search-clear {\n  border: 0;\n  background: transparent;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  margin-right: 11px;\n  color: #746b6c;\n  display: inline-flex;\n}\n\n.search-popover,\n.nav-popover {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: calc(100% + 7px);\n  left: 0;\n  z-index: 12;\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 13px 15px;\n  background: #fffdfa;\n  border: 1px solid var(--line);\n  box-shadow: 0 10px 24px #28252612;\n}\n\n.popover-label {\n  display: block;\n  color: var(--rose);\n  font-size: 10px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: .12em;\n  margin: 0 0 6px;\n}\n\n.search-popover button {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  width: 100%;\n  border: 0;\n  border-top: 1px solid #eee9e4;\n  padding: 10px 2px;\n  background: transparent;\n  text-align: left;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  font-size: 12px;\n}\n\n.search-popover button span {\n  color: #857c7e;\n  font-size: 10px;\n  margin-bottom: 2px;\n}\n\n.search-popover p {\n  margin: 8px 0 2px;\n  color: #6b6466;\n  font-size: 12px;\n}\n\n.header-actions {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 13px;\n  height: 100%;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n\n.header-action {\n  position: relative;\n  min-width: 62px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 5px;\n  border: 0;\n  padding: 8px 2px;\n  background: transparent;\n  color: var(--ink);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  font-size: 10px;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n.header-action svg {\n  stroke-width: 1.6;\n}\n\n.header-action small,\n.bag-wrap small {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 0;\n  right: 5px;\n  width: 17px;\n  height: 17px;\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: var(--rose);\n  color: white;\n  font-size: 9px;\n}\n\n.bag-wrap {\n  position: relative;\n  display: inline-flex;\n}\n\n.mobile-menu-toggle,\n.mobile-search {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n.primary-nav {\n  min-height: 39px;\n  max-width: 1440px;\n  margin: auto;\n  padding: 0 4.5% 9px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: clamp(21px, 3vw, 45px);\n}\n\n.primary-nav button {\n  position: relative;\n  border: 0;\n  padding: 5px 0 7px;\n  background: transparent;\n  text-transform: none;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  font-size: 11px;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n.primary-nav button::after {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  bottom: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  width: 0;\n  height: 1px;\n  background: var(--rose);\n  transition: width .18s ease;\n}\n\n.primary-nav button:hover::after,\n.primary-nav button.active::after {\n  width: 100%;\n}\n\n.nav-popover {\n  top: 100%;\n  left: auto;\n  right: 4.5%;\n  width: min(420px, 92vw);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 4px 17px;\n  padding: 19px 22px;\n}\n\n.nav-popover button {\n  padding: 8px 0;\n  border: 0;\n  background: transparent;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  font-size: 12px;\n}\n\n.nav-popover .rose-link {\n  width: 100%;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  color: var(--rose);\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);\n  margin-top: 5px;\n  padding-top: 14px;\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   HERO CAROUSEL — Redesigned Component System\n   ============================================================ */\n\n.hero-carousel-container {\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: clamp(560px, 48vw, 640px);\n  min-height: 520px;\n  max-height: 640px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  background: #f7f6f3;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  outline: none;\n}\n\n.hero-slides-viewport {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  z-index: 0;\n}\n\n.hero-slide {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  opacity: 0;\n  pointer-events: none;\n  visibility: hidden;\n  transform: translate3d(100%, 0, 0);\n  transition: transform 800ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),\n    opacity 800ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),\n    visibility 800ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);\n  will-change: transform, opacity;\n}\n\n.hero-carousel-container.dir-prev .hero-slide {\n  transform: translate3d(-100%, 0, 0);\n}\n\n.hero-slide.active {\n  opacity: 1;\n  visibility: visible;\n  pointer-events: auto;\n  transform: translate3d(0%, 0, 0) !important;\n  z-index: 2;\n}\n\n.hero-slide.exiting {\n  opacity: 0.98;\n  visibility: visible;\n  transform: translate3d(-100%, 0, 0);\n  z-index: 1;\n}\n\n.hero-carousel-container.dir-prev .hero-slide.exiting {\n  transform: translate3d(100%, 0, 0);\n}\n\n.hero-picture-wrap {\n  display: block;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n}\n\n.hero-slide-image {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  object-position: var(--focal-desktop, 68% 50%);\n  transform: scale(1.01) translate3d(0, 0, 0);\n  transition: transform 800ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);\n  will-change: transform;\n}\n\n.hero-slide.active .hero-slide-image {\n  transform: scale(1) translate3d(0, 0, 0);\n}\n\n.hero-slide.exiting .hero-slide-image {\n  transform: scale(0.995) translate3d(0, 0, 0);\n}\n\n/* Subtle readability gradient over image */\n\n.hero-gradient-overlay {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  z-index: 1;\n  pointer-events: none;\n  background: linear-gradient(90deg,\n      rgba(247, 246, 243, 0.94) 0%,\n      rgba(247, 246, 243, 0.18) 36%,\n      rgba(247, 246, 243, 0.02) 64%,\n      transparent 84%);\n}\n\n/* HTML Copy Overlay */\n\n.hero-copy-overlay {\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 2;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: var(--container, 1320px);\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: 0 4.5%;\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n.hero-copy-content {\n  pointer-events: auto;\n  max-width: 480px;\n}\n\n.hero-copy-content.animate-copy {\n  animation: heroCopyTransition 400ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) both;\n}\n\n@keyframes heroCopyTransition {\n  from {\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: translate3d(0, 7px, 0);\n  }\n\n  to {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);\n  }\n}\n\n.eyebrow {\n  margin: 0;\n  color: #55484a;\n  font-size: 9.5px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.22em;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.hero-copy-content h1 {\n  margin: 16px 0 14px;\n  font-family: var(--serif);\n  font-size: clamp(38px, 4.4vw, 56px);\n  font-weight: 500;\n  line-height: 1.05;\n  letter-spacing: -0.035em;\n  color: #1f1b1c;\n}\n\n.hero-intro {\n  max-width: 440px;\n  margin: 0 0 24px;\n  font-size: 14.5px;\n  line-height: 1.55;\n  color: #484144;\n}\n\n.hero-actions {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 14px;\n}\n\n.hero-cta,\n.hero-cta-secondary {\n  min-height: 46px;\n  padding: 0 18px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(177, 85, 109, 0.65);\n  color: var(--rose);\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(6px);\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  text-decoration: none;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  transition: background 180ms ease, color 180ms ease, border-color 180ms ease;\n}\n\n.hero-cta:hover,\n.hero-cta-secondary:hover {\n  background: var(--rose);\n  border-color: var(--rose);\n  color: #ffffff;\n}\n\n.hero-cta svg,\n.hero-cta-secondary svg {\n  transition: transform 180ms ease;\n}\n\n.hero-cta:hover svg,\n.hero-cta-secondary:hover svg {\n  transform: translate3d(3px, 0, 0);\n}\n\n/* Minimal Centered Dot Indicators inside Hero Image */\n\n/* =========================================================\n   HERO INDICATORS — stable dot → pill morph\n   ========================================================= */\n\n.hero-indicators {\n  position: absolute;\n  z-index: 3;\n  left: 50%;\n  bottom: 20px;\n\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n\n  padding: 5px 7px;\n  gap: 2px;\n\n  transform: translate3d(-50%, 0, 0);\n\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);\n  border-radius: 999px;\n\n  background: rgba(40, 37, 38, 0.20);\n\n  box-shadow:\n    0 2px 12px rgba(40, 37, 38, 0.08);\n\n  pointer-events: auto;\n}\n\n/* Large invisible interaction area */\n\n.hero-dot-btn {\n  width: 38px;\n  height: 24px;\n\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n\n  padding: 0;\n  border: 0;\n  background: transparent;\n\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n/* The visible indicator */\n\n.hero-dot-pill {\n  display: block;\n\n  width: 8px;\n  height: 8px;\n\n  flex: 0 0 auto;\n\n  border: 0;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.52);\n\n  box-shadow:\n    0 1px 4px rgba(40, 37, 38, 0.14);\n\n  opacity: 0.82;\n\n  transition:\n    width 260ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),\n    opacity 220ms ease,\n    background-color 220ms ease,\n    box-shadow 220ms ease,\n    transform 220ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);\n}\n\n/* Hover inactive indicators */\n\n.hero-dot-btn:hover .hero-dot-pill {\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);\n  opacity: 1;\n  transform: scale(1.08);\n}\n\n/* Active = permanent capsule */\n\n.hero-dot-btn.active .hero-dot-pill {\n  width: 30px;\n\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.98);\n\n  opacity: 1;\n\n  transform: scale(1);\n\n  box-shadow:\n    0 1px 6px rgba(40, 37, 38, 0.18);\n}\n\n/* Don't draw a huge focus ring around the 38px hit area */\n\n.hero-dot-btn:focus-visible {\n  outline: none;\n}\n\n/* Focus the actual visual indicator instead */\n\n.hero-dot-btn:focus-visible .hero-dot-pill {\n  box-shadow:\n    0 0 0 2px rgba(167, 84, 107, 0.75),\n    0 1px 6px rgba(40, 37, 38, 0.18);\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .hero-indicators {\n    bottom: 14px;\n    padding: 4px 6px;\n  }\n\n  .hero-dot-btn {\n    width: 36px;\n    height: 34px;\n  }\n\n  .hero-dot-pill {\n    width: 7px;\n    height: 7px;\n  }\n\n  .hero-dot-btn.active .hero-dot-pill {\n    width: 26px;\n  }\n}\n\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  .hero-dot-pill {\n    transition: none;\n  }\n}\n\n/* ============================================================\n   HOMEPAGE KOREAN BRANDS MARQUEE (The K-Skin Gallery)\n   ============================================================ */\n\n.home-brands {\n  position: relative;\n  background: #fffdfb;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(40, 37, 38, 0.07);\n  padding: 30px 0 22px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  width: 100%;\n}\n\n.home-brands__header {\n  max-width: 1440px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: 0 clamp(16px, 4.5vw, 48px);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: flex-end;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 16px;\n  margin-bottom: 22px;\n}\n\n.home-brands__title-group {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n}\n\n.home-brands__eyebrow {\n  display: block;\n  font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 10px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.18em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--rose, #a7546b);\n  margin-bottom: 5px;\n}\n\n.home-brands__heading {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-family: var(--serif, 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif);\n  font-size: clamp(24px, 2.5vw, 32px);\n  font-weight: 500;\n  color: var(--ink, #282526);\n  line-height: 1.15;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n\n.home-brands__heading-accent {\n  display: inline-block;\n  width: 3px;\n  height: 0.76em;\n  background: var(--rose, #a7546b);\n  margin-right: 11px;\n  border-radius: 1.5px;\n}\n\n.home-brands__cta {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n  font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  color: var(--rose, #a7546b);\n  text-decoration: none;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  transition: transform 180ms ease, color 180ms ease;\n  padding-bottom: 2px;\n}\n\n.home-brands__cta:hover {\n  transform: translateX(2px);\n  color: #8c3f55;\n}\n\n.home-brands__cta-text-short {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n.home-brands__marquee {\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(\n    to right,\n    transparent 0%,\n    black 6%,\n    black 94%,\n    transparent 100%\n  );\n  mask-image: linear-gradient(\n    to right,\n    transparent 0%,\n    black 6%,\n    black 94%,\n    transparent 100%\n  );\n}\n\n.home-brands__marquee-track {\n  display: flex;\n  width: max-content;\n  will-change: transform;\n  animation: brands-infinite-marquee 54s linear infinite;\n}\n\n.home-brands__marquee-track:focus-within {\n  animation-play-state: paused;\n}\n\n.home-brands__marquee-group {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: clamp(54px, 5.5vw, 84px);\n  padding-right: clamp(54px, 5.5vw, 84px);\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.home-brands__logo-item {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  width: clamp(120px, 10vw, 170px);\n  height: 64px;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  text-decoration: none;\n  opacity: 0.78;\n  transition: opacity 180ms ease, transform 180ms ease;\n}\n\n.home-brands__logo-item:hover {\n  opacity: 1;\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\n}\n\n.home-brands__logo-item:focus-visible {\n  opacity: 1;\n  outline: 2px solid var(--rose, #a7546b);\n  outline-offset: 4px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n.home-brands__logo-slot {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n}\n\n.home-brands__logo-img {\n  max-width: 100%;\n  max-height: 38px;\n  width: auto;\n  height: auto;\n  object-fit: contain;\n  display: block;\n  user-select: none;\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n.home-brands__logo-fallback {\n  font-family: var(--serif, 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif);\n  font-size: 15px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--ink, #282526);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  user-select: none;\n}\n\n@keyframes brands-infinite-marquee {\n  0% {\n    transform: translateX(0);\n  }\n  100% {\n    transform: translateX(-50%);\n  }\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .home-brands {\n    padding: 24px 0 18px;\n  }\n\n  .home-brands__header {\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n  }\n\n  .home-brands__heading {\n    font-size: clamp(20px, 5.5vw, 26px);\n  }\n\n  .home-brands__cta-text-full {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  .home-brands__cta-text-short {\n    display: inline;\n  }\n\n  .home-brands__marquee-track {\n    animation-duration: 36s;\n  }\n\n  .home-brands__marquee-group {\n    gap: clamp(38px, 9vw, 56px);\n    padding-right: clamp(38px, 9vw, 56px);\n  }\n\n  .home-brands__logo-item {\n    width: clamp(96px, 24vw, 130px);\n    height: 52px;\n  }\n\n  .home-brands__logo-img {\n    max-height: 32px;\n  }\n}\n\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  .home-brands__marquee-track {\n    animation: none;\n    transform: none;\n  }\n\n  .home-brands__marquee {\n    overflow-x: auto;\n    -webkit-mask-image: none;\n    mask-image: none;\n  }\n\n  .home-brands__marquee-group[aria-hidden=\"true\"] {\n    display: none;\n  }\n}\n\n.text-link {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 9px;\n  flex: 0 0 auto;\n  border: 0;\n  padding: 7px 0;\n  background: transparent;\n  color: var(--rose);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.text-link:hover {\n  color: #803d52;\n}\n\n.selection-section {\n  max-width: 1440px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: 19px 3.3% 28px;\n  scroll-margin-top: 20px;\n}\n\n.section-heading {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: end;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  margin-bottom: 13px;\n}\n\n.section-eyebrow {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n.section-heading h2 {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-family: var(--serif);\n  font-size: 30px;\n  line-height: 1.13;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  letter-spacing: -.02em;\n}\n\n.section-heading .text-link {\n  margin-bottom: 1px;\n}\n\n.product-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr));\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.product-card {\n  min-width: 0;\n  background: #fbfaf8;\n  border: 1px solid #f2efec;\n  transition: border-color .2s ease, transform .2s ease;\n}\n\n.product-card:hover {\n  border-color: #ddd2ce;\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\n}\n\n.product-image-area {\n  position: relative;\n  height: 183px;\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n}\n\n.product-image-area img {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  object-fit: contain;\n  mix-blend-mode: multiply;\n}\n\n.product-note {\n  position: absolute;\n  left: 10px;\n  top: 9px;\n  max-width: 115px;\n  background: #f7e7e9;\n  padding: 5px 7px;\n  color: #76505b;\n  font-size: 8px;\n  letter-spacing: .02em;\n}\n\n.favorite-button {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 7px;\n  right: 8px;\n  display: grid;\n  width: 31px;\n  height: 31px;\n  place-items: center;\n  border: 1px solid #eee8e4;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: #fffdfa;\n  color: #675f61;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.favorite-button:hover,\n.favorite-button.is-favorite {\n  color: var(--rose);\n  border-color: #dcbec6;\n}\n\n.product-info {\n  padding: 9px 11px 11px;\n}\n\n.product-brand {\n  margin: 0 0 4px;\n  color: #4b4346;\n  font-size: 10px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n.product-info h3 {\n  min-height: 34px;\n  margin: 0;\n  color: #282526;\n  font-size: 10px;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  line-height: 1.45;\n}\n\n.product-size {\n  margin: 3px 0 8px;\n  color: #837b7d;\n  font-size: 9px;\n}\n\n.product-buy {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.product-buy strong {\n  color: var(--rose);\n  font-size: 14px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n.add-button {\n  min-height: 31px;\n  width: 100%;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: 7px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--rose);\n  border-radius: 3px;\n  background: var(--rose);\n  color: #fff;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  font-size: 9px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.add-button:hover {\n  background: #884459;\n}\n\n.empty-results {\n  grid-column: 1 / -1;\n  min-height: 180px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: 7px;\n  color: #756d70;\n}\n\n.empty-results p {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-size: 13px;\n}\n\n.routine-band {\n  min-height: 174px;\n  padding: 25px 3.3%;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1.38fr repeat(3, 1fr) .9fr;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0;\n  background: #f8eaec;\n  border-top: 1px solid #f0e2e3;\n}\n\n.routine-intro {\n  padding-right: 18px;\n}\n\n.routine-intro .eyebrow {\n  font-size: 8px;\n  letter-spacing: .18em;\n}\n\n.routine-intro h2 {\n  margin: 6px 0 5px;\n  font-family: var(--serif);\n  font-size: clamp(20px, 2.05vw, 28px);\n  font-weight: 500;\n  letter-spacing: -.025em;\n  line-height: 1.1;\n}\n\n.routine-intro>p:last-child {\n  margin: 0;\n  color: #595154;\n  font-size: 11px;\n}\n\n.routine-step {\n  position: relative;\n  min-height: 72px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  gap: 12px;\n  padding: 1px clamp(10px, 1.6vw, 24px);\n  border-left: 1px solid #d8c5c8;\n}\n\n.routine-step>span {\n  width: 30px;\n  height: 30px;\n  flex: 0 0 auto;\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: var(--rose);\n  color: white;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.routine-step h3 {\n  margin: 1px 0 6px;\n  font-family: var(--serif);\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: 500;\n}\n\n.routine-step p {\n  max-width: 150px;\n  margin: 0;\n  color: #62595b;\n  font-size: 10px;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\n\n.step-sparkle {\n  position: absolute;\n  right: 10px;\n  bottom: 1px;\n  color: #c9b7a6;\n}\n\n.routine-cta {\n  justify-self: end;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  font-size: 10px;\n  padding: 0 14px;\n}\n\n.bottom-trust {\n  min-height: 76px;\n  padding: 14px 4.5%;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 15px;\n  background: #fffdfa;\n}\n\n.bottom-trust>div {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  color: #595154;\n  font-size: 10px;\n}\n\n.bottom-trust svg {\n  color: var(--rose);\n}\n\n.site-footer {\n  padding: 20px 5% 22px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 18px;\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);\n  background: #f4f0ec;\n  color: #6d6566;\n  font-size: 10px;\n}\n\n.footer-brand {\n  width: 150px;\n  line-height: 0;\n}\n\n.footer-brand img {\n  width: 100%;\n}\n\n.site-footer>span {\n  flex: 1;\n}\n\n.site-footer>div {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 18px;\n}\n\n.site-footer>div button {\n  border: 0;\n  background: transparent;\n  padding: 0;\n  color: inherit;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  font-size: inherit;\n}\n\n.site-footer>small {\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n.mobile-tabbar {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n.overlay {\n  position: fixed;\n  inset: 0;\n  z-index: 30;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: flex-end;\n  background: #211c1d66;\n}\n\n.cart-drawer,\n.mobile-drawer {\n  width: min(455px, 100%);\n  height: 100%;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  background: #fffdfa;\n  box-shadow: -8px 0 35px #1c151420;\n  animation: slide-in .22s ease-out;\n}\n\n@keyframes slide-in {\n  from {\n    transform: translateX(20px);\n    opacity: .7;\n  }\n\n  to {\n    transform: translateX(0);\n    opacity: 1;\n  }\n}\n\n.drawer-head {\n  min-height: 74px;\n  padding: 16px 22px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);\n}\n\n.drawer-head>div {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 4px;\n}\n\n.drawer-head span {\n  font-family: var(--serif);\n  font-size: 21px;\n}\n\n.drawer-head small {\n  color: #746c6e;\n  font-size: 10px;\n}\n\n.drawer-head>button {\n  display: grid;\n  width: 36px;\n  height: 36px;\n  place-items: center;\n  border: 1px solid var(--line);\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: transparent;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.cart-lines {\n  flex: 1;\n  overflow-y: auto;\n  padding: 5px 22px;\n}\n\n.cart-line {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 82px 1fr auto;\n  gap: 12px;\n  align-items: center;\n  padding: 15px 0;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #eee9e4;\n}\n\n.cart-line>img {\n  width: 82px;\n  height: 100px;\n  object-fit: contain;\n  background: white;\n  mix-blend-mode: multiply;\n}\n\n.cart-line-copy {\n  min-width: 0;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 4px;\n}\n\n.cart-line-copy strong {\n  font-size: 11px;\n}\n\n.cart-line-copy>span {\n  color: #494346;\n  font-size: 10px;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n\n.cart-line-copy>small {\n  color: #82797b;\n  font-size: 9px;\n}\n\n.cart-line>b {\n  align-self: start;\n  padding-top: 3px;\n  color: var(--rose);\n  font-size: 11px;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n.quantity-control {\n  width: fit-content;\n  margin-top: 4px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  border: 1px solid #ded8d3;\n}\n\n.quantity-control button {\n  width: 27px;\n  height: 25px;\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n  border: 0;\n  background: transparent;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.quantity-control span {\n  min-width: 25px;\n  text-align: center;\n  font-size: 10px;\n}\n\n.cart-summary {\n  padding: 18px 22px 25px;\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);\n}\n\n.cart-summary>p,\n.checkout-total {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  margin: 0 0 7px;\n  font-size: 13px;\n}\n\n.cart-summary>p strong,\n.checkout-total strong {\n  color: var(--rose);\n  font-size: 16px;\n}\n\n.cart-summary>small {\n  color: #756c6e;\n  font-size: 10px;\n}\n\n.checkout-button {\n  width: 100%;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  margin-top: 18px;\n}\n\n.cod-note {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: 7px;\n  margin-top: 12px;\n  color: #62595b;\n  font-size: 10px;\n}\n\n.cart-empty {\n  flex: 1;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 30px;\n  text-align: center;\n  color: #726a6c;\n}\n\n.cart-empty>svg {\n  color: var(--rose);\n}\n\n.cart-empty h3 {\n  margin: 13px 0 4px;\n  color: var(--ink);\n  font-family: var(--serif);\n  font-size: 22px;\n  font-weight: 500;\n}\n\n.cart-empty p {\n  max-width: 270px;\n  margin: 0 0 16px;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  line-height: 1.55;\n}\n\n.mobile-drawer {\n  width: min(390px, 100%);\n  padding-bottom: 20px;\n}\n\n.mobile-drawer>button {\n  min-height: 49px;\n  margin: 0 22px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  border: 0;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #eee9e4;\n  background: transparent;\n  text-align: left;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  font-size: 13px;\n}\n\n.checkout-overlay {\n  justify-content: center;\n  align-items: center;\n  padding: 20px;\n}\n\n.checkout-modal {\n  width: min(560px, 100%);\n  max-height: min(90vh, 820px);\n  overflow-y: auto;\n  background: #fffdfa;\n  box-shadow: 0 15px 45px #211c1d30;\n}\n\n.checkout-form {\n  padding: 18px 24px 24px;\n}\n\n.checkout-form>p {\n  margin: 0 0 14px;\n  font-family: var(--serif);\n  font-size: 19px;\n}\n\n.form-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.form-grid label {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 5px;\n  color: #4e4749;\n  font-size: 10px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.form-grid label small {\n  display: inline;\n  color: #81787a;\n  font-weight: 400;\n}\n\n.form-grid input {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 39px;\n  padding: 0 11px;\n  border: 1px solid #ded8d3;\n  border-radius: 3px;\n  background: white;\n  font-size: 11px;\n}\n\n.full-field {\n  grid-column: 1 / -1;\n}\n\n.checkout-total {\n  margin-top: 19px;\n  padding-top: 14px;\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);\n  font-size: 11px;\n}\n\n.checkout-privacy {\n  display: block;\n  margin-top: 10px;\n  color: #746c6e;\n  text-align: center;\n  font-size: 9px;\n}\n\n.order-success {\n  padding: 35px 35px 40px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n.success-mark {\n  width: 58px;\n  height: 58px;\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: #e7efe8;\n  color: #496a52;\n}\n\n.order-success h2 {\n  margin: 17px 0 7px;\n  font-family: var(--serif);\n  font-size: 30px;\n  font-weight: 500;\n}\n\n.order-success p {\n  max-width: 380px;\n  margin: 0 0 20px;\n  color: #645c5e;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n}\n\n.toast {\n  position: fixed;\n  z-index: 40;\n  right: 22px;\n  bottom: 22px;\n  max-width: min(400px, calc(100% - 30px));\n  min-height: 46px;\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 9px;\n  background: #282526;\n  color: white;\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 22px #17131425;\n  font-size: 11px;\n  animation: toast-in .18s ease-out;\n}\n\n@keyframes toast-in {\n  from {\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: translateY(6px);\n  }\n\n  to {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: translateY(0);\n  }\n}\n\n.toast>svg {\n  color: #eccbd2;\n}\n\n.toast button {\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n  margin-left: 7px;\n  border: 0;\n  background: transparent;\n  color: white;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n@media (min-width: 1500px) {\n  .hero-copy {\n    padding-left: calc((100vw - 1350px) / 2);\n  }\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 1100px) {\n  .header-main {\n    grid-template-columns: 195px minmax(220px, 1fr) 210px;\n    gap: 15px;\n    padding-inline: 3%;\n  }\n\n  .logo-link {\n    width: 190px;\n  }\n\n  .header-actions {\n    gap: 4px;\n  }\n\n  .primary-nav {\n    gap: clamp(13px, 2vw, 24px);\n    padding-top: 4px;\n  }\n\n  .primary-nav button {\n    font-size: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .hero-copy {\n    width: 51%;\n  }\n\n  .hero h1 {\n    font-size: clamp(42px, 4.8vw, 54px);\n  }\n\n  .hero-intro {\n    max-width: 340px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n\n  .hero-caption {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  .hero-promises {\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .hero-promises b {\n    font-size: 9px;\n  }\n\n  .hero-promises small {\n    font-size: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .brand-strip {\n    gap: 12px;\n  }\n\n\n  .routine-band {\n    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr repeat(3, 1fr);\n    row-gap: 20px;\n  }\n\n  .routine-cta {\n    grid-column: 4;\n    grid-row: 2;\n  }\n\n  .site-footer {\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 760px) {\n  html {\n    scroll-padding-top: 15px;\n  }\n\n  .trust-bar {\n    height: 31px;\n    gap: 8px;\n    padding: 0 8px;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    font-size: 9px;\n  }\n\n  .trust-item {\n    gap: 5px;\n  }\n\n  .trust-item svg {\n    width: 14px;\n    height: 14px;\n  }\n\n  .trust-item:nth-of-type(3) {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  .trust-divider:nth-of-type(2) {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  .header-main {\n    height: 67px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 8px;\n    padding: 5px 16px;\n  }\n\n  .mobile-menu-toggle {\n    display: grid;\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n    width: 33px;\n    height: 38px;\n    place-items: center;\n    padding: 0;\n    border: 0;\n    background: transparent;\n    cursor: pointer;\n  }\n\n  .logo-link {\n    width: 145px;\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  .header-main>.search-wrap {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  .header-actions {\n    height: auto;\n    gap: 3px;\n  }\n\n  .header-action {\n    min-width: 38px;\n    width: 38px;\n    height: 40px;\n    padding: 4px;\n  }\n\n  .header-action>span:not(.bag-wrap) {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  .header-action small,\n  .bag-wrap small {\n    top: -2px;\n    right: -2px;\n    width: 15px;\n    height: 15px;\n    font-size: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .header-action svg {\n    width: 20px;\n    height: 20px;\n  }\n\n  .mobile-search {\n    display: flex;\n    height: 40px;\n    margin: 0 15px 10px;\n  }\n\n  .mobile-search input {\n    font-size: 11px;\n  }\n\n  .mobile-search .search-icon {\n    width: 17px;\n    margin-left: 12px;\n  }\n\n  .primary-nav {\n    min-height: 0;\n    padding: 0 0 10px;\n    justify-content: flex-start;\n    overflow-x: auto;\n    gap: 21px;\n    scrollbar-width: none;\n  }\n\n  .primary-nav::-webkit-scrollbar {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  .primary-nav button {\n    padding: 4px 0;\n    font-size: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .primary-nav button:first-child {\n    margin-left: 16px;\n  }\n\n  .primary-nav button:last-child {\n    margin-right: 16px;\n  }\n\n  .nav-popover {\n    right: 12px;\n    width: calc(100% - 24px);\n  }\n\n  .brand-strip {\n    min-height: 60px;\n    padding: 12px 16px;\n    gap: 12px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n\n\n\n  .selection-section {\n    padding: 22px 15px 24px;\n  }\n\n  .section-heading {\n    align-items: end;\n    margin-bottom: 11px;\n  }\n\n  .section-eyebrow {\n    display: block;\n    margin-bottom: 3px;\n    font-size: 7px;\n    letter-spacing: .14em;\n  }\n\n  .section-heading h2 {\n    font-size: 24px;\n  }\n\n  .section-heading .text-link {\n    max-width: 112px;\n    gap: 4px;\n    padding-bottom: 3px;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    text-align: right;\n  }\n\n  .section-heading .text-link svg {\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n    width: 13px;\n  }\n\n  .product-grid {\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\n    gap: 9px;\n  }\n\n  .product-card:last-of-type:nth-child(odd) {\n    grid-column: 1 / -1;\n  }\n\n  .product-image-area {\n    height: clamp(145px, 45vw, 205px);\n  }\n\n  .product-note {\n    left: 6px;\n    top: 6px;\n    max-width: 92px;\n    padding: 4px 5px;\n    font-size: 7px;\n  }\n\n  .favorite-button {\n    top: 5px;\n    right: 5px;\n    width: 27px;\n    height: 27px;\n  }\n\n  .favorite-button svg {\n    width: 16px;\n  }\n\n  .product-info {\n    padding: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .product-brand {\n    font-size: 9px;\n  }\n\n  .product-info h3 {\n    min-height: 42px;\n    font-size: 9px;\n  }\n\n  .product-size {\n    margin: 2px 0 7px;\n    font-size: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .product-buy {\n    gap: 7px;\n  }\n\n  .product-buy strong {\n    font-size: 12px;\n  }\n\n  .add-button {\n    min-height: 31px;\n    gap: 5px;\n    font-size: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .add-button svg {\n    width: 13px;\n  }\n\n  .routine-band {\n    padding: 24px 16px 22px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 0;\n  }\n\n  .routine-intro {\n    grid-column: 1 / -1;\n    padding: 0 0 17px;\n  }\n\n  .routine-intro .eyebrow {\n    font-size: 7px;\n  }\n\n  .routine-intro h2 {\n    margin-top: 5px;\n    font-size: 26px;\n  }\n\n  .routine-intro>p:last-child {\n    font-size: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .routine-step {\n    min-height: 77px;\n    gap: 8px;\n    padding: 4px 7px 4px 0;\n  }\n\n  .routine-step:nth-of-type(3) {\n    border-left: 1px solid #d8c5c8;\n    padding-left: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .routine-step:nth-of-type(4) {\n    border-left: 0;\n  }\n\n  .routine-step>span {\n    width: 25px;\n    height: 25px;\n    font-size: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .routine-step h3 {\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n\n  .routine-step p {\n    max-width: 130px;\n    font-size: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .step-sparkle {\n    width: 16px;\n    right: 4px;\n    bottom: 2px;\n  }\n\n  .routine-cta {\n    grid-column: 1 / -1;\n    grid-row: 3;\n    justify-self: stretch;\n    min-height: 39px;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n  }\n\n  .bottom-trust {\n    min-height: unset;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 11px 5px;\n    padding: 17px 14px;\n  }\n\n  .bottom-trust>div {\n    justify-content: flex-start;\n    font-size: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .bottom-trust svg {\n    width: 16px;\n  }\n\n  .site-footer {\n    padding: 18px 16px 85px;\n    gap: 7px 12px;\n  }\n\n  .footer-brand {\n    width: 126px;\n  }\n\n  .site-footer>span {\n    font-size: 9px;\n  }\n\n  .site-footer>div {\n    width: 100%;\n    gap: 15px;\n    padding: 7px 0;\n    font-size: 9px;\n  }\n\n  .site-footer>small {\n    font-size: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .mobile-tabbar {\n    position: fixed;\n    z-index: 15;\n    right: 0;\n    bottom: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    min-height: 61px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    padding: 7px 5px max(7px, env(safe-area-inset-bottom));\n    border-top: 1px solid #e8e1dc;\n    background: #fffdfa;\n  }\n\n  .mobile-tabbar button {\n    flex: 1;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 4px;\n    border: 0;\n    background: transparent;\n    color: #544c4e;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    font-size: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .mobile-tabbar button:hover {\n    color: var(--rose);\n  }\n\n  .mobile-tabbar svg {\n    stroke-width: 1.7;\n  }\n\n  .toast {\n    right: 12px;\n    bottom: 74px;\n    left: 12px;\n    width: fit-content;\n    font-size: 10px;\n  }\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 370px) {\n  .logo-link {\n    width: 125px;\n  }\n\n  .hero-promises {\n    gap: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .hero-promises>div:nth-of-type(2) {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  .product-grid {\n    gap: 7px;\n  }\n\n  .product-info {\n    padding: 7px;\n  }\n\n  .section-heading .text-link {\n    max-width: 94px;\n  }\n}\n\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n\n  *,\n  *::before,\n  *::after {\n    scroll-behavior: auto !important;\n    animation-duration: .01ms !important;\n    animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;\n    transition-duration: .01ms !important;\n  }\n}"],["STYLE",{},":root {\n  --space-1: 4px; --space-2: 8px; --space-3: 12px; --space-4: 16px;\n  --space-6: 24px; --space-8: 32px; --space-12: 48px; --space-16: 64px;\n  --container: 1320px; --radius-sm: 4px; --radius-md: 10px;\n  --shadow-panel: 0 12px 36px #28252614;\n}\nbutton, input, select, textarea { font: inherit; }\nbutton:disabled { opacity: .55; cursor: not-allowed; }\nselect, textarea { color: var(--ink); }\nselect:focus-visible, textarea:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--rose); outline-offset: 2px; }\n.site-shell { min-height: 100vh; }\n.header-main { height: 145px; grid-template-columns: 200px minmax(280px, 1fr) 285px; }\n.logo-link { width: 190px; }\n.hero h1 { font-size: clamp(42px, 4.5vw, 62px); }\n.primary-nav a { position: relative; padding: 5px 0 7px; font-size: 11px; white-space: nowrap; }\n.primary-nav a::after { content: ''; position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; width: 0; height: 1px; background: var(--rose); transition: width .18s; }\n.primary-nav a:hover::after, .primary-nav a.active::after { width: 100%; }\n.footer-main a:hover { color: var(--rose); }\n.mobile-drawer > a { min-height: 49px; margin: 0 22px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee9e4; font-size: 13px; }\n.mobile-drawer > a.drawer-divider { margin-top: 13px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }\n.product-image-link { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; }\n.product-image-link img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; }\n.product-info h3:hover { color: var(--rose); }\n.product-buy > div { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 6px; }\n.product-buy del, .pdp-price del { color: #857d7f; font-size: 11px; }\n.stock-button { background: #fff; color: var(--rose); }\n.stock-button:hover { background: var(--petal); }\n.search-popover { max-height: min(440px, 65vh); overflow: auto; }\n.search-popover button span { order: 2; color: var(--ink); font-size: 11px; }\n.search-popover .popover-label:not(:first-child) { margin-top: 8px; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }\n.api-banner { padding: 12px 24px; background: #ffe5e5; color: #7a2737; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; }\n\n.home-discovery, .promo-band, .related-products { max-width: var(--container); margin: auto; padding: 36px 3.3%; }\n.home-discovery .section-heading h2 { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 29px; font-weight: 500; }\n.discovery-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); gap: 12px; }\n.discovery-tile { min-height: 96px; display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; padding: 16px; border: 1px solid #eadfe0; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fffdfa, #f3e6e4); font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 17px; transition: transform .18s; }\n.discovery-tile:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); color: var(--rose); }\n.discovery-tile svg { flex: 0 0 auto; color: var(--rose); }\n.skin-discovery .discovery-tile { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #faf8f4, #ece7df); }\n.promo-band { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; background: #f6e7e9; }\n.promo-band h2 { margin: 6px 0 0; font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 28px; font-weight: 500; }\n.routine-band .routine-cta { grid-column: auto; grid-row: auto; }\n\n.inner-page { max-width: var(--container); min-height: 55vh; margin: 0 auto; padding: 34px 3.3% 72px; }\n.page-heading { margin-bottom: 28px; }\n.page-heading h1, .inner-page > h1, .receipt-page h1 { margin: 5px 0 9px; font-family: var(--serif); font-size: clamp(30px, 3.3vw, 48px); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.16; }\n.page-heading > p:last-child { color: #655d5f; font-size: 13px; }\n.quiet-note { color: #6c6365; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; }\n.directory-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 14px; }\n.directory-card { min-height: 118px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; align-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 22px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: #fffdfa; }\n.directory-card:hover { border-color: #d4abb6; }\n.directory-card > span { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 21px; }\n.directory-card small { grid-column: 1; color: #71686a; font-size: 11px; }\n.directory-card > svg:last-child { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1 / span 2; color: var(--rose); }\n.directory-card > svg:first-child { grid-column: 1 / -1; color: var(--rose); }\n.collection-toolbar { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 12px 0; margin: 18px 0; font-size: 12px; }\n.collection-toolbar label { margin-left: auto; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; }\n.collection-toolbar select, .filters select { min-height: 37px; padding: 6px 10px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: white; }\n.collection-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 220px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 25px; }\n.filters { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 19px; }\n.filters h2 { margin: 0; font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 500; font-size: 22px; }\n.filters label { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; }\n.filters .checkbox-row { flex-direction: row; align-items: center; font-weight: 400; }\n.filters .text-link { justify-content: flex-start; }\n.collection-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); }\n.filter-toggle { display: none; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: white; padding: 7px 10px; align-items: center; gap: 7px; }\n.state-panel { min-height: 250px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; padding: 32px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: #fffdfa; text-align: center; }\n.state-panel h1, .state-panel h2 { margin: 0; font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 500; }\n.state-panel p { max-width: 450px; margin: 0 0 7px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: #625a5d; }\n.state-panel > svg { color: var(--rose); }\n.skeleton-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 12px; }\n.skeleton-card, .skeleton-pdp { min-height: 330px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #eee9e3, #f9f6f3, #eee9e3); background-size: 200% 100%; animation: skeleton 1.4s infinite linear; }\n@keyframes skeleton { to { background-position: -200% 0; } }\n.search-page-form { display: flex; max-width: 660px; gap: 8px; margin: 22px 0; }\n.search-page-form input { flex: 1; min-width: 0; padding: 0 15px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: white; }\n\n.breadcrumbs { margin-bottom: 28px; color: #71686a; font-size: 11px; }\n.breadcrumbs a:hover { color: var(--rose); }\n.pdp-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(0, .95fr); gap: clamp(30px, 5vw, 78px); }\n.pdp-image { min-height: 525px; display: grid; place-items: center; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: white; }\n.pdp-image img { width: 100%; height: 525px; object-fit: contain; }\n.pdp-info { padding: 16px 0; }\n.pdp-info h1 { margin: 12px 0; font-family: var(--serif); font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 43px); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.2; }\n.pdp-size { color: #736a6c; font-size: 13px; }\n.pdp-price { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px; margin: 22px 0 8px; color: var(--rose); font-size: 27px; font-weight: 700; }\n.stock-ok, .stock-out { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; }\n.stock-ok { color: #32643f; } .stock-out { color: #9a3d4d; }\n.pdp-actions { display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: end; margin: 25px 0 18px; }\n.pdp-actions label { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px; font-size: 11px; }\n.pdp-actions select { height: 45px; min-width: 75px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: white; }\n.pdp-actions .button-primary { flex: 1; }\n.favorite-inline { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 5px 0; border: 0; background: transparent; cursor: pointer; font-size: 12px; }\n.favorite-inline svg { color: var(--rose); }\n.pdp-promises { display: flex; gap: 23px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); margin-top: 26px; padding-top: 19px; font-size: 11px; }\n.pdp-promises span { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }\n.pdp-promises svg { color: var(--rose); }\n.product-details { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 0 45px; margin: 52px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }\n.product-details section { padding: 19px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }\n.product-details h2, .stock-alert-form h2 { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 500; font-size: 22px; }\n.product-details p { color: #655d5f; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.7; }\n.product-details a { color: var(--rose); text-decoration: underline; }\n.stock-alert-form { display: grid; gap: 12px; margin: 22px 0; }\n.stock-alert-form label { display: grid; gap: 7px; font-size: 12px; }\n.stock-alert-form input { height: 42px; padding: 0 12px; border: 1px solid var(--line); }\n\n.cart-line > a:first-child img { width: 82px; height: 100px; object-fit: contain; background: white; }\n.cart-line-copy > a { color: #494346; font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.4; }\n.cart-line-copy > a:hover { color: var(--rose); }\n.cart-summary > small { display: block; margin-top: 5px; }\n.remove-link { width: fit-content; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; padding: 2px 0; border: 0; background: transparent; color: #8b5362; font-size: 10px; cursor: pointer; }\n.cart-page-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 330px; align-items: start; gap: 34px; }\n.cart-page-lines { background: #fffdfa; border: 1px solid var(--line); }\n.cart-page-line { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 112px minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: 16px; align-items: center; padding: 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }\n.cart-page-line:last-child { border: 0; }\n.cart-page-line img { width: 112px; height: 120px; object-fit: contain; background: white; }\n.cart-page-line h2 { margin: 5px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; }\n.cart-page-line p { color: #776e70; font-size: 11px; }\n.cart-page-line > div:last-child { text-align: right; }\n.cart-page-line .quantity-control { margin-left: auto; }\n.order-summary { padding: 22px; background: #fffdfa; border: 1px solid var(--line); }\n.order-summary h2 { margin: 0 0 22px; font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 500; font-size: 24px; }\n.order-summary > p:not(.form-error) { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 15px; font-size: 12px; }\n.order-summary > small { display: block; color: #776e70; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.5; }\n.order-summary .button-primary { width: 100%; }\n.order-summary .quiet-note { display: block !important; color: var(--rose); }\n\n.checkout-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 380px; align-items: start; gap: 36px; }\n.checkout-page-form { display: grid; gap: 16px; }\n.form-section { padding: 26px; background: #fffdfa; border: 1px solid var(--line); }\n.form-section h2 { margin: 0 0 20px; font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 500; font-size: 24px; }\n.form-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }\n.form-grid label, .auth-form label, .admin-editor label, .coupon-field, .stock-alert-form label { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px; color: #4e4749; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }\n.form-grid input, .form-grid select, .form-grid textarea, .auth-form input, .admin-editor input:not([type=checkbox]), .admin-editor select, .admin-editor textarea, .coupon-field input { width: 100%; min-height: 43px; padding: 9px 11px; border: 1px solid #d8d0ca; border-radius: 3px; background: white; font-size: 12px; }\n.form-grid textarea, .admin-editor textarea { resize: vertical; }\n.form-grid label small { font-weight: 400; }\n.payment-method { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding: 16px; border: 1px solid #d7a9b5; background: #fdf6f7; }\n.payment-method > svg { color: var(--rose); }\n.payment-method div { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; flex: 1; }\n.payment-method small { color: #72686b; font-size: 11px; }\n.payment-method > span { color: var(--rose); }\n.checkout-submit { min-height: 49px; justify-content: space-between; }\n.checkout-assurance { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; color: #685e61; font-size: 11px; }\n.checkout-summary { position: sticky; top: 20px; }\n.summary-line { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 52px 1fr auto; align-items: center; gap: 9px; padding: 11px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }\n.summary-line img { width: 52px; height: 58px; object-fit: contain; }\n.summary-line > div { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; }\n.summary-line strong { font-size: 10px; }\n.summary-line span, .summary-line small { font-size: 10px; color: #6e6567; }\n.summary-line b { white-space: nowrap; font-size: 10px; }\n.coupon-field { margin: 20px 0; }\n.grand-total { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 14px; font-weight: 700; }\n.grand-total strong { color: var(--rose); }\n.form-error { padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid #edc6cd; background: #fff0f2; color: #8c273b; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; }\n.receipt-page { max-width: 760px; text-align: center; }\n.receipt-page .success-mark { margin: 10px auto; }\n.receipt-page > p { font-size: 13px; color: #635b5d; line-height: 1.6; }\n.receipt-card { margin: 25px auto; padding: 22px; background: white; border: 1px solid var(--line); text-align: left; }\n.receipt-card h2 { margin: 0 0 16px; font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 500; }\n.receipt-card p { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 7px 0; font-size: 12px; }\n.receipt-card p span { max-width: 70%; }\n.receipt-card p:last-child { border: 0; }\n\n.auth-page { max-width: 610px; }\n.auth-form { display: grid; gap: 18px; padding: 28px; background: #fffdfa; border: 1px solid var(--line); }\n.auth-form > p:last-child { margin: 0; font-size: 12px; }\n.rose-link { color: var(--rose); font-weight: 600; }\n.order-list { border: 1px solid var(--line); background: white; }\n.order-list-item { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr auto auto; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding: 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 12px; }\n.order-list-item:hover { background: #fff7f8; }\n.info-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }\n.info-grid section { padding: 25px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: white; }\n.info-grid h2 { margin: 0 0 12px; font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 22px; font-weight: 500; }\n.info-grid p { font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.7; color: #625a5d; }\n.info-contact { font-size: 13px; }\n\n.full-footer { display: block; padding: 42px 5% 20px; }\n.site-footer > .footer-main { max-width: var(--container); width: 100%; margin: auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 40px; }\n.footer-main > div { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: start; gap: 9px; }\n.footer-main .footer-brand { width: 190px; }\n.footer-main p { margin: 0; color: #6d6566; font-size: 11px; }\n.footer-main h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; color: var(--ink); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; }\n.footer-main a:not(.footer-brand) { font-size: 11px; }\n.site-footer > .footer-bottom { max-width: var(--container); width: 100%; margin: 35px auto 0; padding-top: 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; border-top: 1px solid #ded7d0; font-size: 10px; }\n\n.admin-shell { min-height: 100vh; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 225px minmax(0, 1fr); background: #f5f4f2; }\n.admin-sidebar { padding: 26px 20px; background: #fffdfa; border-right: 1px solid var(--line); }\n.admin-logo { display: block; margin-bottom: 29px; font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.1; }\n.admin-logo strong { color: var(--rose); }\n.admin-logo small { display: block; margin-top: 7px; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 10px; color: #756d70; }\n.admin-sidebar nav { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px; }\n.admin-sidebar nav a { padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px; }\n.admin-sidebar nav a:hover, .admin-sidebar nav a.active { background: #f5e7eb; color: #8c4358; }\n.admin-store-link { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin: 30px 10px; color: var(--rose); font-size: 11px; }\n.admin-content { min-width: 0; max-width: 1440px; width: 100%; margin: auto; padding: 32px; }\n.admin-content h1 { margin: 0 0 25px; font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 500; font-size: 32px; }\n.admin-content h2 { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 500; font-size: 22px; }\n.admin-stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 20px; }\n.admin-stats > a, .admin-stats > div { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; padding: 20px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--line); }\n.admin-stats span { color: #635b5d; font-size: 12px; }\n.admin-stats strong { font-size: 27px; }\n.value-stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n.admin-heading { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 18px; }\n.admin-heading h1 { margin: 0; }\n.admin-heading label { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; font-size: 12px; }\n.admin-heading select { min-height: 36px; border: 1px solid var(--line); }\n.admin-table-wrap { width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; background: white; border: 1px solid var(--line); }\n.admin-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12px; }\n.admin-table th, .admin-table td { padding: 13px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); text-align: left; vertical-align: middle; }\n.admin-table th { background: #f7f3f0; color: #5a5053; font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .07em; }\n.admin-table a { color: var(--rose); font-weight: 600; }\n.admin-table button { border: 0; background: transparent; color: var(--rose); cursor: pointer; font-size: 11px; }\n.admin-table input[type=number] { width: 75px; padding: 5px; border: 1px solid var(--line); }\n.status-pill { display: inline-flex; padding: 5px 9px; border-radius: 20px; background: #f6e7e9; color: #843e52; font-size: 10px; }\n.admin-detail-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }\n.admin-panel { padding: 22px; margin: 0 0 16px; background: white; border: 1px solid var(--line); }\n.admin-panel h2 { margin: 0 0 15px; }\n.admin-panel p { font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; }\n.call-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; color: var(--rose); font-weight: 700; }\n.admin-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }\n.admin-actions button { min-height: 37px; padding: 0 12px; font-size: 11px; }\n.admin-order-line { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 60px 1fr auto; gap: 12px; align-items: center; padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 12px; }\n.admin-order-line img { width: 60px; height: 65px; object-fit: contain; }\n.summary-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }\n.status-history { padding-left: 20px; }\n.status-history li { padding: 5px 0; font-size: 12px; }\n.status-history li > * { margin-right: 12px; }\n.status-history small { color: #786f71; }\n.admin-toolbar { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 15px; }\n.admin-toolbar input { width: min(360px, 70%); height: 40px; padding: 0 12px; border: 1px solid var(--line); }\n.admin-product-name { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; min-width: 240px; }\n.admin-product-name img { width: 46px; height: 50px; object-fit: contain; }\n.admin-product-name small { color: #72686b; }\n.admin-editor { display: grid; gap: 17px; max-width: 790px; }\n.admin-editor-top { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px; }\n.admin-editor-top img { width: 100px; height: 110px; object-fit: contain; }\n.admin-checks { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; }\n.admin-checks label { flex-direction: row; align-items: center; }\n.admin-editor .button-primary { justify-self: start; }\n.catalog-admin-filters { flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-start; gap: 8px; }\n.catalog-admin-filters input { flex: 1 1 220px; }\n.catalog-admin-filters select, .admin-bulk-toolbar select, .admin-bulk-toolbar input:not([type=checkbox]) { min-height: 40px; padding: 0 10px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: #fff; }\n.catalog-admin-filters span { margin-left: auto; color: #756d70; font-size: 12px; }\n.admin-bulk-toolbar { display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }\n.admin-bulk-toolbar > label { display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center; gap: 7px; font-size: 12px; }\n.admin-bulk-toolbar > span { color: #756d70; font-size: 11px; }\n.admin-bulk-toolbar .button-primary { min-height: 38px; }\n.admin-bulk-toolbar p { flex-basis: 100%; margin: 0; }\n.catalog-state { display: inline-flex; white-space: nowrap; padding: 5px 8px; border: 1px solid #e4d9d9; border-radius: 3px; color: #65595b; background: #fbf8f6; font-size: 10px; }\n.catalog-stock-out_of_stock, .catalog-verify-needs_review { color: #883d50; border-color: #e8c6cf; background: #fff2f4; }\n.catalog-stock-low_stock, .catalog-verify-partial { color: #825f2d; border-color: #e9ddc7; background: #fff9eb; }\n.catalog-stock-in_stock, .catalog-verify-verified, .catalog-publication-published { color: #426a4e; border-color: #d1e1d2; background: #f2faf3; }\n.catalog-publication-draft, .catalog-publication-archived, .catalog-verify-unverified { color: #6b6264; }\n.admin-product-section { display: grid; gap: 14px; padding: 19px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: #fffdfa; }\n.admin-product-section h2 { margin: 0; }\n.admin-product-section .form-grid { margin: 0; }\n.admin-image-gallery { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }\n.admin-image-gallery figure { width: 110px; margin: 0; }\n.admin-image-gallery img { width: 110px; height: 120px; object-fit: contain; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: white; }\n.admin-image-gallery figcaption { padding-top: 4px; color: #71676a; font-size: 10px; }\n\n@media (max-width: 1100px) {\n  .header-main { height: 130px; grid-template-columns: 170px minmax(220px, 1fr) 210px; }\n  .logo-link { width: 165px; }\n  .collection-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); }\n  .checkout-layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 320px; gap: 20px; }\n  .routine-band { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }\n}\n@media (max-width: 760px) {\n  .header-main { height: 83px; }\n  .logo-link { width: 105px; }\n  .primary-nav { display: none; }\n  .site-header { padding-bottom: 1px; }\n  .mobile-drawer { overflow-y: auto; }\n  .mobile-tabbar a { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 4px; color: #544c4e; font-size: 8px; }\n  .mobile-tabbar a.active { color: var(--rose); }\n  .home-discovery, .promo-band, .related-products { padding: 25px 16px; }\n  .home-discovery .section-heading h2 { font-size: 24px; }\n  .discovery-grid { display: flex; overflow-x: auto; scroll-snap-type: x mandatory; padding-bottom: 5px; }\n  .discovery-tile { flex: 0 0 42%; min-height: 88px; scroll-snap-align: start; font-size: 15px; }\n  .promo-band { display: block; }\n  .promo-band h2 { font-size: 23px; margin-bottom: 16px; }\n  .routine-band { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; gap: 0; }\n  .routine-intro { padding-bottom: 17px; }\n  .routine-step, .routine-step:nth-of-type(3), .routine-step:nth-of-type(4) { min-height: 65px; padding: 8px 0; border-left: 0; border-top: 1px solid #d8c5c8; }\n  .routine-cta { grid-column: auto; grid-row: auto; margin-top: 12px; }\n  .inner-page { padding: 25px 15px 90px; }\n  .directory-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 9px; }\n  .directory-card { min-height: 95px; padding: 14px; }\n  .directory-card > span { font-size: 16px; }\n  .collection-layout { display: block; }\n  .filter-toggle { display: inline-flex; }\n  .filter-panel { display: none; margin-bottom: 20px; }\n  .filter-panel.open { display: block; }\n  .filter-panel .filters { padding: 18px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: white; }\n  .collection-grid, .skeleton-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }\n  .collection-grid .product-card:last-of-type:nth-child(odd) { grid-column: auto; }\n  .pdp-layout, .product-details, .cart-page-layout, .checkout-layout, .info-grid, .admin-detail-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  .pdp-image, .pdp-image img { height: 380px; min-height: 0; }\n  .pdp-info { padding: 5px 0; }\n  .pdp-info h1 { font-size: 29px; }\n  .product-details { margin: 30px 0; }\n  .pdp-promises { flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }\n  .cart-page-line { grid-template-columns: 75px minmax(0, 1fr); }\n  .cart-page-line img { width: 75px; height: 95px; }\n  .cart-page-line > div:last-child { grid-column: 2; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }\n  .checkout-summary { position: static; grid-row: 1; }\n  .checkout-page-form { grid-row: 2; }\n  .checkout-layout { display: flex; flex-direction: column-reverse; }\n  .checkout-layout > * { width: 100%; }\n  .form-section { padding: 20px 16px; }\n  .form-grid { gap: 12px; }\n  .receipt-card { padding: 16px; }\n  .full-footer { padding: 30px 16px 88px; }\n  .site-footer > .footer-main { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 24px 15px; padding: 0; }\n  .footer-main > div:first-child { grid-column: 1 / -1; }\n  .site-footer > .footer-bottom { flex-direction: column; gap: 7px; padding-top: 16px; }\n  .admin-shell { display: block; }\n  .admin-sidebar { padding: 14px; }\n  .admin-logo { margin-bottom: 10px; }\n  .admin-sidebar nav { display: flex; flex-direction: row; overflow-x: auto; }\n  .admin-sidebar nav a { white-space: nowrap; }\n  .admin-store-link { display: none; }\n  .admin-content { padding: 20px 14px 90px; }\n  .admin-stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n  .admin-stats strong { font-size: 21px; }\n}\n@media (max-width: 420px) {\n  .directory-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }\n  .discovery-tile { flex-basis: 58%; }\n  .form-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  .form-grid .full-field { grid-column: 1; }\n  .order-list-item { grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; }\n  .order-list-item span { grid-column: 1; }\n  .checkout-layout { gap: 15px; }\n  .cart-line { grid-template-columns: 70px 1fr auto; gap: 7px; }\n  .cart-line > a:first-child img { width: 70px; }\n}\n\n/* Information architecture V2 */\n.primary-nav .promo-link { color: var(--rose); }\n.mobile-search-toggle, .mobile-search-head { display: none; }\n\n.gallery-entry, .home-guided { max-width: var(--container); margin: auto; padding: 45px 3.3%; }\n.gallery-entry .section-heading h2, .home-guided .section-heading h2 { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 31px; font-weight: 500; }\n.gallery-entry-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 13px; }\n.gallery-entry-card { min-height: 205px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; padding: 22px; border: 1px solid #e7dcd9; background: linear-gradient(145deg, #fffdfa, #f8eeec); transition: transform .18s, border-color .18s; }\n.gallery-entry-card:nth-child(2) { background: linear-gradient(145deg, #fffdfa, #f2ece5); }\n.gallery-entry-card:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); border-color: #cca4af; }\n.entry-number { color: var(--rose); font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 16px; }\n.gallery-entry-card h3 { margin: 10px 0 4px; font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 23px; font-weight: 500; }\n.gallery-entry-card p { margin: 0; color: #6e6568; font-size: 12px; }\n.entry-action, .home-guided-card > span { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; color: var(--rose); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; }\n.home-guided-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }\n.home-guided-card { min-height: 172px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; padding: 20px; background: #fffdfa; border: 1px solid var(--line); }\n.home-guided-card > svg { color: var(--rose); }\n.home-guided-card h3 { margin: 12px 0 5px; font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 19px; font-weight: 500; }\n.home-guided-card p { margin: 0; color: #6b6265; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.5; }\n.home-guided-card > span { margin-top: auto; padding-top: 15px; }\n.home-pack-card { background: #f7e9eb; }\n.skin-discovery .discovery-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); }\n\n.directory-section { margin: 32px 0 48px; }\n.directory-section > h2 { margin: 0 0 16px; font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 27px; font-weight: 500; }\n.directory-section .directory-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); }\n.quick-pills { display: flex; gap: 8px; overflow-x: auto; padding: 4px 0 13px; scrollbar-width: thin; }\n.quick-pills button { flex: 0 0 auto; min-height: 34px; border: 1px solid #ded6d2; border-radius: 30px; padding: 6px 14px; background: #fffdfa; cursor: pointer; font-size: 11px; }\n.quick-pills button.active, .quick-pills button:hover { border-color: var(--rose); background: #f8eaee; color: #87475a; }\n.filter-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }\n.filter-head button { display: none; border: 0; background: transparent; cursor: pointer; }\n.filter-section { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 11px 0; }\n.filter-section summary { cursor: pointer; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; }\n.facet-options { display: grid; gap: 3px; margin-top: 10px; }\n.facet-options button { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; width: 100%; border: 0; padding: 7px 6px; background: transparent; text-align: left; cursor: pointer; font-size: 11px; }\n.facet-options button.selected, .facet-options button:hover { background: #f9ebee; color: #8c4358; }\n.facet-options small { color: #81777a; }\n.price-filter { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 8px; margin-top: 11px; }\n.price-filter label { display: grid; gap: 4px; font-size: 10px; }\n.price-filter input { width: 100%; min-width: 0; height: 36px; padding: 6px; border: 1px solid var(--line); }\n.price-filter button { grid-column: 1 / -1; min-height: 32px; border: 1px solid var(--rose); background: #fff; color: var(--rose); cursor: pointer; }\n.filter-clear { margin-top: 8px; border: 0; background: transparent; cursor: pointer; }\n.filter-apply { display: none; }\n.selected-filters { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 7px; margin: 0 0 18px; }\n.selected-filters button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; min-height: 28px; padding: 4px 9px; border: 1px solid #d8bec5; border-radius: 20px; background: #faedf0; cursor: pointer; font-size: 10px; }\n.selected-filters .clear-all { border-color: transparent; background: transparent; text-decoration: underline; }\n.pagination { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 18px; margin: 30px 0; font-size: 12px; }\n.pagination a { color: var(--rose); font-weight: 700; }\n\n.guided-step { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 28px 0 36px; }\n.guided-step-head { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 19px; margin-bottom: 21px; }\n.guided-step-head > span { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 38px; height: 38px; flex: 0 0 auto; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--rose); color: white; font-family: var(--serif); }\n.guided-step-head h2 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 25px; font-weight: 500; }\n.guided-step-head p { margin: 0 0 9px; color: #6c6264; font-size: 12px; }\n.guided-products { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }\n.routine-select { width: 100%; min-height: 35px; margin-bottom: 6px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 7px; border: 1px solid #d4bdc3; background: #fff; color: var(--rose); cursor: pointer; font-size: 11px; }\n.routine-select.selected { background: var(--rose); color: white; }\n.routine-selection-bar { position: sticky; bottom: 0; z-index: 3; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 15px; padding: 15px 20px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: #fffdfa; box-shadow: 0 -8px 20px #2825260e; font-size: 12px; }\n.pack-components { margin-top: 54px; }\n.pack-components h2 { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 27px; font-weight: 500; }\n.pack-component-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }\n.pack-component { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 82px 1fr 20px; align-items: center; gap: 13px; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: white; }\n.pack-component img { width: 82px; height: 90px; object-fit: contain; }\n.pack-component span { display: grid; gap: 5px; }\n.pack-component small { color: var(--rose); }\n.pack-component strong { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }\n.pack-component em { color: #736b6c; font-size: 10px; font-style: normal; }\n.advice-article { max-width: 880px; }\n.article-body { padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }\n.article-body p { margin: 0 0 19px; color: #4f484a; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8; white-space: pre-line; }\n.admin-nav-group { display: flex; flex-direction: column; margin-bottom: 18px; }\n.admin-nav-group h2 { margin: 0 10px 5px; color: #95888c; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .13em; text-transform: uppercase; }\n.admin-sidebar nav .admin-nav-group a { display: block; }\n.admin-taxonomy-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 10px; }\n.admin-taxonomy-checks { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 9px; min-width: 0; padding: 14px; border: 1px solid var(--line); }\n.admin-taxonomy-checks legend { padding: 0 5px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; }\n.admin-taxonomy-checks label, .admin-verify { display: flex !important; flex-direction: row !important; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; }\n.admin-editor .admin-taxonomy-checks input, .admin-editor .admin-verify input { width: auto; min-height: auto; }\n.admin-subform { margin-top: 22px; }\n.admin-subform h3 { margin: 7px 0 0; font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 500; }\n.admin-component-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 80px auto; gap: 9px; }\n.admin-component-row select, .admin-component-row input { min-width: 0; }\n.admin-component-row button, .admin-step-editor button { border: 0; background: transparent; color: var(--rose); cursor: pointer; font-size: 11px; }\n.admin-step-editor { display: grid; gap: 12px; padding: 15px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: #fdfbf9; }\n.admin-step-editor strong { font-size: 12px; }\n.admin-step-editor select[multiple] { min-height: 120px; }\n\n@media (max-width: 760px) {\n  .header-actions .header-action:not(:last-child) { display: none; }\n  .mobile-search-toggle { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 38px; height: 40px; border: 0; background: transparent; cursor: pointer; }\n  .mobile-search { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 40; width: 100%; height: 100dvh; display: block; margin: 0; padding: 17px 15px; border: 0; border-radius: 0; background: #fffdfa; overflow-y: auto; }\n  .mobile-search-head { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 19px; font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 19px; }\n  .mobile-search-head button { border: 0; background: transparent; cursor: pointer; }\n  .mobile-search > .search-icon { position: absolute; top: 77px; left: 14px; }\n  .mobile-search input { display: block; width: 100%; height: 48px; padding: 0 44px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 4px; }\n  .mobile-search .search-clear { position: absolute; top: 78px; right: 22px; }\n  .mobile-search .search-popover { position: static; width: 100%; max-height: none; margin-top: 12px; border: 0; box-shadow: none; }\n  .mobile-search .search-popover button { min-height: 45px; }\n  .gallery-entry, .home-guided { padding: 30px 16px; }\n  .gallery-entry .section-heading h2, .home-guided .section-heading h2 { font-size: 26px; }\n  .gallery-entry-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 9px; }\n  .gallery-entry-card { min-height: 130px; padding: 16px; }\n  .gallery-entry-card h3 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 19px; }\n  .home-guided-grid { display: flex; overflow-x: auto; scroll-snap-type: x mandatory; }\n  .home-guided-card { flex: 0 0 70%; scroll-snap-align: start; }\n  .directory-section .directory-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }\n  .collection-toolbar { flex-wrap: wrap; }\n  .collection-toolbar label { margin-left: 0; }\n  .filter-panel, .filter-panel.open { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 35; margin: 0; background: #fffdfa; overflow-y: auto; }\n  .filter-panel { display: none; }\n  .filter-panel.open { display: block; }\n  .filter-panel .filters { min-height: 100%; display: block; padding: 20px 18px 85px; border: 0; }\n  .filter-head button { display: inline-flex; }\n  .filter-section { padding: 16px 0; }\n  .filter-apply { position: fixed; right: 0; bottom: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; display: flex; justify-content: center; min-height: 62px; }\n  .guided-products { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }\n  .routine-selection-bar { bottom: 61px; padding: 10px; }\n  .routine-selection-bar .button-primary { font-size: 10px; }\n  .pack-component-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  .admin-sidebar nav .admin-nav-group { display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center; gap: 4px; margin: 0; }\n  .admin-nav-group h2 { white-space: nowrap; margin: 0 4px; }\n  .admin-taxonomy-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  .admin-component-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr 65px auto; }\n  .admin-content { padding: 22px 14px; }\n  .admin-bulk-toolbar { padding: 14px; }\n  .admin-bulk-toolbar > * { flex: 1 1 100%; }\n  .admin-bulk-toolbar > label { flex: 1 1 auto; }\n  .catalog-admin-filters > input, .catalog-admin-filters > select { width: 100%; max-width: none; flex: 1 1 100%; }\n  .catalog-admin-filters span { margin-left: 0; }\n  .admin-product-section { padding: 14px; }\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 430px) {\n  .directory-section .directory-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }\n  .home-guided-card { flex-basis: 82%; }\n  .gallery-entry-card { min-height: 135px; }\n}\n.pdp-thumbnails { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-top: 14px; overflow-x: auto; }\n.pdp-thumbnails button { flex: 0 0 76px; height: 84px; padding: 4px; border: 1px solid var(--line, #e7ddda); background: #fff; }\n.pdp-thumbnails button[aria-pressed=\"true\"] { border-color: var(--rose, #aa5368); }\n.pdp-thumbnails img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; }\n"],["STYLE",{},"/* Compact Gallery commerce header. Other storefront sections keep their styles. */\n.site-header {\n  position: sticky;\n  top: 0;\n  z-index: 40;\n  background: var(--gallery-white);\n  box-shadow: 0 1px 0 #2825260b;\n  padding-bottom: 0;\n}\n.header-main {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 1440px;\n  height: 64px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: 0 clamp(22px, 4.1vw, 62px);\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(280px, min(50vw, 620px)) minmax(0, 1fr);\n  gap: clamp(15px, 2.4vw, 34px);\n  align-items: center;\n}\n.logo-link { position: relative; width: 128px; height: 64px; overflow: hidden; }\n.brand-logo { position: absolute; top: -16px; left: 0; width: 128px; max-width: none; height: auto; }\n.header-main > .search-wrap {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 620px;\n  height: 43px;\n  margin: auto;\n  background: #fffdfa;\n  border-color: #ddd6d3;\n  transition: border-color 200ms cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1), box-shadow 200ms cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);\n}\n.header-main > .search-wrap:focus-within { border-color: var(--rose); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px #a7546b17; }\n.search-wrap input { font-size: 12px; }\n.search-popover { z-index: 35; background: var(--gallery-white); border-color: #ded6d3; box-shadow: 0 12px 28px #28252618; }\n.search-popover .search-all-results { flex-direction: row; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; color: var(--rose); font-weight: 700; }\n.header-actions { height: auto; justify-content: flex-end; gap: clamp(8px, 1.7vw, 22px); }\n.header-action {\n  width: auto;\n  min-width: 0;\n  height: 40px;\n  padding: 0 2px;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  flex-direction: row;\n  gap: 7px;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  transition: color 150ms cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);\n}\n.header-action:hover { color: var(--rose); }\n.header-action > small { top: 2px; right: -8px; width: 15px; height: 15px; font-size: 8px; }\n.bag-wrap small { top: -8px; right: -9px; width: 15px; height: 15px; font-size: 8px; }\n.mobile-search-toggle { display: none; }\n.primary-nav {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 1440px;\n  min-height: 38px;\n  height: 38px;\n  margin: auto;\n  padding: 0 22px;\n  gap: clamp(19px, 3vw, 42px);\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n.primary-nav a {\n  position: relative;\n  height: 100%;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  padding: 0;\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: .025em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n.primary-nav a::after {\n  bottom: 3px;\n  left: 0;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 2px;\n  transform: scaleX(0);\n  transform-origin: center;\n  transition: transform 180ms cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);\n}\n.primary-nav a:hover::after, .primary-nav a.active::after { width: 100%; transform: scaleX(1); }\n.trust-marquee {\n  height: 30px;\n  max-height: 30px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #efcfd8;\n  color: #614a50;\n}\n.trust-scroller {\n  width: max-content;\n  height: 30px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  animation: gallery-trust-marquee 34s linear infinite;\n}\n.trust-track {\n  --trust-gap: clamp(18px, 2.5vw, 34px);\n  flex: 0 0 auto;\n  min-width: 100vw;\n  height: 30px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-around;\n  gap: var(--trust-gap);\n  padding-inline: calc(var(--trust-gap) / 2);\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n.trust-marquee:hover .trust-scroller { animation-play-state: paused; }\n.trust-item { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; white-space: nowrap; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 500; }\n.trust-item svg { flex: 0 0 auto; color: #a7546b; }\n.trust-sparkle { flex: 0 0 auto; color: #b47788; font-size: 10px; }\n.trust-mobile-copy { display: none; }\n@keyframes gallery-trust-marquee { to { transform: translateX(-50%); } }\n.site-header.is-scrolled { box-shadow: 0 6px 20px #28252614; }\n.overlay { z-index: 80; }\n\n@media (max-width: 1160px) {\n  .header-main { padding-inline: 28px; gap: 18px; }\n  .logo-link { width: 128px; }\n  .brand-logo { width: 128px; top: -16px; }\n  .header-action > span:not(.bag-wrap) { display: none; }\n  .header-actions { gap: 11px; }\n  .header-action { width: 34px; }\n  .primary-nav { gap: clamp(17px, 2.7vw, 32px); }\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 760px) {\n  .header-main {\n    height: 54px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 76px minmax(0, 1fr) 76px;\n    gap: 0;\n    padding: 0 13px;\n  }\n  .mobile-menu-toggle { display: grid; width: 36px; height: 42px; justify-self: start; place-items: center; }\n  .logo-link { width: 108px; height: 54px; justify-self: center; }\n  .brand-logo { width: 108px; top: -14px; }\n  .header-main > .search-wrap { display: none; }\n  .header-actions { width: 76px; gap: 0; justify-content: space-between; }\n  .header-actions .header-action:not(:last-child) { display: none; }\n  .header-action { width: 36px; height: 40px; padding: 0; }\n  .mobile-search-toggle { display: grid; width: 36px; height: 40px; padding: 0; place-items: center; border: 0; background: transparent; }\n  .primary-nav { display: none; }\n  .trust-marquee { height: 28px; max-height: 28px; }\n  .trust-scroller, .trust-track { height: 28px; }\n  .trust-item { gap: 5px; font-size: 9px; }\n  .trust-item svg { width: 13px; height: 13px; }\n  .trust-track { --trust-gap: 15px; }\n  .trust-desktop-copy { display: none; }\n  .trust-mobile-copy { display: inline; }\n  .filter-panel, .filter-panel.open { z-index: 70; }\n  .mobile-search {\n    position: fixed;\n    inset: 0;\n    z-index: 90;\n    display: block;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100dvh;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 16px 16px 30px;\n    overflow-y: auto;\n    border: 0;\n    border-radius: 0;\n    background: var(--gallery-white);\n  }\n  .mobile-search:focus-within { border: 0; box-shadow: none; }\n  .mobile-search-head { display: flex; justify-content: flex-start; gap: 13px; align-items: center; height: 32px; margin: 0; font-size: 18px; }\n  .mobile-search-head button { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 32px; height: 32px; padding: 0; }\n  .mobile-search > .search-icon { position: absolute; top: 74px; left: 17px; width: 18px; height: 18px; margin: 0; }\n  .mobile-search input { display: block; width: 100%; height: 46px; margin-top: 16px; padding: 0 42px; border: 1px solid #ded6d3; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 13px; }\n  .mobile-search input:focus { border-color: var(--rose); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px #a7546b17; }\n  .mobile-search .search-clear { position: absolute; top: 74px; right: 22px; }\n  .mobile-search .search-popover { position: static; width: 100%; max-height: none; margin-top: 12px; padding: 0 2px; border: 0; box-shadow: none; }\n  .mobile-search .search-popover button { min-height: 45px; }\n}\n\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  .trust-scroller { animation: none; }\n  .trust-track[aria-hidden='true'] { display: none; }\n  .trust-track { --trust-gap: 9px; }\n  .site-header *, .site-header *::before, .site-header *::after { animation-duration: .01ms !important; transition-duration: .01ms !important; }\n}\n@media (max-width: 760px) and (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  .trust-track { --trust-gap: 6px; }\n  .trust-item { gap: 3px; font-size: 8px; }\n  .trust-item svg { width: 11px; height: 11px; }\n  .trust-sparkle { font-size: 8px; }\n}\n"],["STYLE",{},"/* Primary navigation panels share a shell, while each category keeps its own layout. */\n.gallery-nav-system { position: relative; z-index: 45; }\n.gallery-nav { gap: clamp(17px, 2.5vw, 38px); }\n.gallery-nav-item { height: 100%; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; }\n.gallery-nav-item > a { flex: 0 0 auto; }\n.gallery-nav-item.is-open > a { color: var(--rose); }\n.gallery-nav-item.is-open > a::after { transform: scaleX(1); }\n.gallery-nav-chevron {\n  width: 16px;\n  height: 26px;\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n  padding: 0;\n  border: 0;\n  background: transparent;\n  color: var(--ink);\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n.gallery-nav-chevron svg { opacity: .55; transition: opacity 140ms ease, transform 140ms cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1); }\n.gallery-nav-item:hover .gallery-nav-chevron svg, .gallery-nav-chevron:focus-visible svg { opacity: 1; }\n.gallery-nav-item.is-open .gallery-nav-chevron svg { opacity: 1; transform: rotate(180deg); }\n.gallery-nav-chevron:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--rose); outline-offset: 2px; }\n\n.gallery-mega {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 100%;\n  left: 50%;\n  z-index: 45;\n  width: min(1060px, calc(100vw - 36px));\n  max-height: calc(100dvh - 142px);\n  overflow-y: auto;\n  padding: 26px 34px 28px;\n  border: 1px solid #e9e0dc;\n  border-radius: 0 0 3px 3px;\n  background: #fffdfb;\n  box-shadow: 0 14px 35px #28252614;\n  opacity: 0;\n  visibility: hidden;\n  pointer-events: none;\n  transform: translate(-50%, -4px);\n  transition: width 160ms cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1), opacity 140ms cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1),\n    transform 140ms cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1), visibility 0s linear 140ms;\n}\n.gallery-mega.is-open { opacity: 1; visibility: visible; pointer-events: auto; transform: translate(-50%, 0); transition-delay: 0s; }\n.gallery-mega--brands { width: min(900px, calc(100vw - 36px)); }\n.gallery-mega--care { width: min(1000px, calc(100vw - 36px)); }\n.gallery-mega--skin { width: min(870px, calc(100vw - 36px)); }\n.gallery-mega--routines { width: min(960px, calc(100vw - 36px)); }\n.gallery-mega-inner { opacity: 1; transition: opacity 70ms ease; }\n.gallery-mega.is-switching .gallery-mega-inner { opacity: 0; }\n.gallery-mega-heading { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; padding-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee7e2; }\n.gallery-mega-heading > span { color: var(--rose); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }\n.gallery-mega-heading a, .gallery-mega-feature b { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; color: var(--rose); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; }\n.gallery-mega-heading a:hover, .gallery-mega-feature:hover b { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }\n.gallery-mega-group h2 { margin: 0 0 11px; color: #9d596b; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }\n.gallery-mega-links a { display: block; width: fit-content; min-height: 30px; padding: 5px 0; color: var(--ink); font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; }\n.gallery-mega-links a:hover, .gallery-mega-links a:focus-visible { color: var(--rose); }\n.gallery-brands-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 27px; padding-top: 20px; }\n.gallery-brand-columns { display: grid; grid-auto-flow: column; grid-template-rows: repeat(var(--brand-rows-desktop), minmax(40px, auto)); grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 9px 11px; }\n.gallery-brand-columns a { width: auto; min-height: 40px; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 7px 12px; border: 1px solid #e9e0dc; background: #fffdfb; white-space: nowrap; transition: border-color 140ms ease, background-color 140ms ease, color 140ms ease; }\n.gallery-brand-columns a:hover, .gallery-brand-columns a:focus-visible { border-color: #c999a7; background: #fcf3f4; }\n.gallery-mega-feature { min-height: 174px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; padding: 19px 18px; background: #f9eff0; }\n.gallery-mega-feature > span { color: #9d596b; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }\n.gallery-mega-feature > strong { margin-top: 16px; color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 23px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.15; }\n.gallery-mega-feature > small { margin-top: 8px; color: #6e6064; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.5; }\n.gallery-mega-feature > b { margin-top: auto; padding-top: 14px; }\n.gallery-care-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 54px; padding: 24px 0 20px; }\n.gallery-mega-quick { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 25px; padding-top: 15px; border-top: 1px solid #eee7e2; }\n.gallery-mega-quick span { color: #9d596b; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }\n.gallery-mega-quick a { color: var(--ink); font-size: 12px; }\n.gallery-mega-quick a:hover { color: var(--rose); }\n.gallery-skin-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.15fr; gap: 28px; padding-top: 22px; }\n.gallery-skin-grid > section { padding: 16px 10px; }\n.gallery-skin-needs { padding: 16px 24px !important; background: #fcf4f4; }\n.gallery-skin-needs .gallery-mega-links { columns: 2; column-gap: 20px; }\n.gallery-skin-needs .gallery-mega-links a { break-inside: avoid; }\n.gallery-routine-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 235px; gap: 45px; padding-top: 23px; }\n.gallery-routine-grid .gallery-mega-feature { min-height: 192px; }\n.gallery-routine-grid .gallery-mega-feature > svg { color: var(--rose); margin-bottom: 8px; }\n.gallery-routine-grid .gallery-mega-feature > strong { margin-top: 11px; }\n\n@media (max-width: 1050px) {\n  .gallery-routine-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 200px; gap: 24px; }\n}\n@media (max-width: 850px) {\n  .gallery-mega { padding-inline: 24px; }\n  .gallery-brand-columns { grid-template-rows: repeat(var(--brand-rows-compact), minmax(40px, auto)); grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }\n  .gallery-care-grid { gap: 22px; }\n  .gallery-skin-needs .gallery-mega-links { columns: 1; }\n  .gallery-routine-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }\n  .gallery-routine-grid .gallery-mega-feature { display: none; }\n}\n@media (max-width: 760px) {\n  .gallery-nav-system { display: none; }\n  .gallery-mobile-link, .gallery-mobile-trigger { min-height: 49px; margin: 0 22px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee9e4; background: transparent; color: var(--ink); font-size: 13px; text-align: left; }\n  .gallery-mobile-link > svg { color: #89797d; }\n  .gallery-mobile-accordion { margin: 0 22px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee9e4; }\n  .gallery-mobile-trigger { width: 100%; margin: 0; border-bottom: 0; cursor: pointer; }\n  .gallery-mobile-trigger svg { color: #89797d; transition: transform 140ms cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1); }\n  .gallery-mobile-accordion.is-open .gallery-mobile-trigger svg { transform: rotate(180deg); color: var(--rose); }\n  .gallery-mobile-panel { display: grid; grid-template-rows: 0fr; opacity: 0; transition: grid-template-rows 160ms cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1), opacity 140ms ease; }\n  .gallery-mobile-accordion.is-open .gallery-mobile-panel { grid-template-rows: 1fr; opacity: 1; }\n  .gallery-mobile-panel-inner { min-height: 0; overflow: hidden; padding-left: 14px; }\n  .gallery-mobile-panel section { margin: 9px 0 15px; }\n  .gallery-mobile-panel h3 { margin: 0 0 4px; color: var(--rose); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }\n  .gallery-mobile-panel section a { display: block; padding: 7px 0; color: var(--ink); font-size: 12px; }\n  .gallery-mobile-brand-all { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 6px; padding: 8px 0 12px; color: var(--rose); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; }\n  .gallery-mobile-brand-links { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 8px; padding-bottom: 16px; }\n  .gallery-mobile-brand-links a { min-height: 40px; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px solid #e9e0dc; background: #fffdfb; color: var(--ink); font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.25; }\n  .gallery-mobile-brand-links a:hover { border-color: #c999a7; background: #fcf3f4; color: var(--rose); }\n  .gallery-mobile-panel section a:hover { color: var(--rose); }\n  .gallery-mobile-all { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin: 0 0 17px; padding-top: 9px; border-top: 1px solid #eee9e4; color: var(--rose); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  .gallery-mega, .gallery-mega-inner, .gallery-nav-chevron svg, .gallery-mobile-trigger svg, .gallery-mobile-panel { transition-duration: .01ms; }\n}\n"]],"\n\n",["BODY",{},"\n  ",["DIV",{"id":"root"},["DIV",{"class":"site-shell"},["HEADER",{"class":"site-header "},["DIV",{"class":"header-main"},["BUTTON",{"class":"icon-button mobile-menu-toggle","aria-label":"Ouvrir le menu"},["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"23","height":"23","fill":"currentColor","viewBox":"0 0 256 256"},["path",{"d":"M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H216A8,8,0,0,1,224,128ZM40,72H216a8,8,0,0,0,0-16H40a8,8,0,0,0,0,16ZM216,184H40a8,8,0,0,0,0,16H216a8,